            <div xml:id="m-42ad4c46-5fa9-4355-a611-91362f92c448">
              <lg xml:id="m-cfe033c8-9a65-4db7-aaf0-97b3715c6848">
                <l xml:id="m-c0ca1c2e-ed52-42cb-b6f8-348462fbc87a" facs="#m-dcb3a17d-b618-4e7a-a91f-6d3dae965ec3" label="ambiguous">7767</l><l xml:id="m-6a63267e-83f4-45b4-b692-a1c48c059db9" facs="#m-8fded24c-dfb7-46f0-91c7-5f834288378a" label="text-like">The Paschal Vigil</l><l xml:id="m-534c05a5-baec-4383-949b-f13c0252c736" facs="#m-0963bb70-9d7c-4b21-bf84-4a437f98678e" label="lyrics-like">ri-am circúmdedit, et circumfó¬</l><l xml:id="m-d45735af-7b95-43be-b891-5bf47e3e00f0" facs="#m-4d040178-c014-44ee-b633-4ef91cb5a472" label="ambiguous">dit : et plan¬</l><l xml:id="m-d91a9175-dd6a-4081-aae2-6d997683722b" facs="#m-73142b41-4e49-40dd-b3c7-4ea5d4e1f713" label="lyrics-like">távit víne-am Só¬</l><l xml:id="m-af043cce-bbc9-4b60-a04f-d14dbd0a5adf" facs="#m-af9ace88-51dd-49ce-9647-fcba7324e139" label="lyrics-like">et aedi-fi¬ cá-vit</l><l xml:id="m-9c33a839-33d1-40c3-bc18-32904e8cf699" facs="#m-857a46a0-eab1-4c6f-a853-8f4afa07aa5b" label="ambiguous">rec:</l><l xml:id="m-c33578bb-1fd6-414d-84d8-a8dd7b0376c3" facs="#m-46a3fce2-6914-4dee-98de-609d72afb4eb" label="lyrics-like">túrrim in médi-o é- jus.</l><l xml:id="m-ba4a325b-e5c0-4bf5-a994-9a2843a16654" facs="#m-c7a9ed9c-34ab-42f3-bc2b-3dde354c89cc" label="lyrics-like">V. Et tórcu-lar fódit</l><l xml:id="m-ace360b7-8bf7-4915-943c-0bc5fa301044" facs="#m-7484451f-b9db-4075-86fb-8c08c38bd046" label="lyrics-like">in é¬ a</l><l xml:id="m-fae78f86-0b75-4efb-acff-00c0b1ea0fbc" facs="#m-a768a726-f7b7-489e-af26-5e0d0f0d9a17" label="lyrics-like">vine-a e-nim Dómi-ni Sá¬</l><l xml:id="m-a571b6c0-6ebe-468e-b691-f982f4c83089" facs="#m-8fd09c71-a31d-4482-81e1-e8c940682f75" label="ambiguous">ba- oth,</l><l xml:id="m-1bc1f873-a477-4ffb-8b18-172b7a81036f" facs="#m-4bd6646f-d199-49e4-ac69-04a62db680b1" label="lyrics-like">dó-mus“Is-ra-ël est.</l><l xml:id="m-9cafe3e4-396a-4a61-87ac-791d224e2221" facs="#m-8c172dfc-ad73-4ff0-92a1-7bc1cc7c8fab" label="lyrics-like">Orémus. D. Flectámus génua. D. Leváte.</l><l xml:id="m-f4fb30fd-eacd-4abc-be99-b3a359128a84" facs="#m-18ef1873-a073-48d7-ac72-0a02fa132462" label="text-like">Prayer</l><l xml:id="m-6bc4ddb1-b56d-4ee2-a34b-9999f04d8c83" facs="#m-9e9b1c75-00da-4b9b-998d-694825b212f3" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui in ómnibus Ecclésiae qui et vineárum apud te nómine</l><l xml:id="m-76eb4f27-353a-477b-9f3f-371c5cbb71b0" facs="#m-4abae7a9-b3fb-4e13-b3f4-7a8b99094ee0" label="lyrics-like">U tuae filiis sanctórum pro¬</l><l xml:id="m-5d50c04b-18dd-4014-b1b7-00501e748917" facs="#m-c17f90f0-18b5-44a3-a298-1a703ba10547" label="lyrics-like">censéntur, et ségetum;*ut,</l><l xml:id="m-334dc535-4c2b-4700-a9d9-9011b77ea5a6" facs="#m-3c0d5e8c-644a-4609-83bd-58b30c5c688e" label="lyrics-like">phetárum voce manifestásti, in</l><l xml:id="m-1ea82bb3-4d04-44c0-a160-b93f27a8f0d4" facs="#m-544cf721-bc91-43e6-ab03-965ede356b34" label="lyrics-like">spinárum et tribulórum squa¬</l><l xml:id="m-383d7a05-a91a-4315-9592-b1cc3b7b5bfa" facs="#m-210c556f-6aa0-4e6b-95d7-3b47896dc4d0" label="lyrics-like">lore resecáto, digna efclántur</l><l xml:id="m-ad137816-bf61-4dcc-8dcc-a04094848bff" facs="#m-b0edb6fc-19fc-446c-8b47-f188a430e734" label="lyrics-like">omni loco dominatiónis tuae,</l><l xml:id="m-1704238e-2b01-4549-9450-8baf4898978e" facs="#m-8e0bfd55-b774-4c08-ae6d-739937e8e4f7" label="lyrics-like">fruge fecúndi. Per Dóminum</l><l xml:id="m-82393915-1901-4b36-aa19-37c950f650ad" facs="#m-86029c34-6d1e-4fdb-a915-04fc825c5e48" label="lyrics-like">satórem te bonórum séminum,</l><l xml:id="m-e9fbafd7-3931-404f-a8d6-768fb2e0dfce" facs="#m-0988c58b-1ebe-40ad-abb0-145147e5d362" label="lyrics-like">et electórum pálmitum esse cul¬</l><l xml:id="m-25c9dac4-e3f1-4950-b12f-1e5151c54079" facs="#m-4ebf66d6-75bb-46f4-bf3e-eeff61c7a30a" label="ambiguous">nostrum Jesum Christum Filium</l><l xml:id="m-836f7d87-514f-452b-8d03-c091fafd5b23" facs="#m-15c05ab6-b8aa-4329-9301-4a8f02d72109" label="lyrics-like">tórem:"trbue pópulis tuis,</l><l xml:id="m-7b6b33eb-d819-4062-8a7c-276fb3d81f77" facs="#m-b38379a1-74bb-452f-861f-4ecc9e4b765e" label="ambiguous">tuum.</l><l xml:id="m-10c97033-f4b2-481a-8b6b-28bebcc8c31f" facs="#m-4828b429-9969-450c-a7d2-d4026d774fbb" label="ambiguous">LESSON IV</l><l xml:id="m-a953f04c-83c4-4818-b20a-3deb4c0bd7b4" facs="#m-3b9e10f5-d981-43b5-94b4-180ee90f15f5" label="ambiguous">Deut. 31, 22-30</l><l xml:id="m-2bc71f3a-77cc-410d-833b-5bd360241add" facs="#m-ee352a1e-9d11-46ef-a689-edb4d5adad5f" label="lyrics-like">N diébus illis: Scripsit Móyses</l><l xml:id="m-db540df8-45b8-449e-ab8c-ddb9492cc825" facs="#m-14177dba-6ba0-4642-a108-b9232032f099" label="lyrics-like">ergo scripsit Móyses verba legis</l><l xml:id="m-99463d06-c5d0-4b68-ba9f-1c642a13925f" facs="#m-73bc69a5-6d82-42eb-b5f4-688952d56527" label="lyrics-like">A cánticum, et dócuit filios</l><l xml:id="m-26cb61ba-27ce-4937-82fc-ddcc9053d836" facs="#m-927ddf44-38d3-43c7-ac28-279c3322bdd7" label="lyrics-like">hujus in volúmine, atque com¬</l><l xml:id="m-a0813ec1-824a-4d03-ad53-6278a9daa427" facs="#m-68b1a87e-5f4c-44a8-b256-cd37ce5c710c" label="lyrics-like">Israël. Praecepitque Dóminus</l><l xml:id="m-f248136f-b3b5-4dfa-a26d-fe6f6c87f20a" facs="#m-33a0b927-5c5a-4721-8bb7-ed34a5fecfd8" label="lyrics-like">plévit: praecépit Levitis, qui</l><l xml:id="m-ef3c024e-2400-4ac9-a644-a0098927ba85" facs="#m-3a08c121-d395-47fa-b8be-6fc87cd0409e" label="lyrics-like">Jósue filio Nun, et ait: « Con¬</l><l xml:id="m-f3278fa4-3f01-49e5-aabf-629a98e82b6e" facs="#m-30f087fc-273a-4848-8158-509fbe5cb03f" label="lyrics-like">portábant arcam fœ́deris Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-cf75ed65-7a67-458e-b108-ac77d5905a5b" facs="#m-9ca589a2-cdf8-483f-ba22-964d94552914" label="lyrics-like">mini, dicens: «Tóllite librum</l><l xml:id="m-0b812d51-b71b-43a1-a855-7d044d04c310" facs="#m-4f699b19-3dfe-4a6e-93a5-7b96c7019289" label="lyrics-like">fortáre, et esto robústus: tu</l><l xml:id="m-b890af88-a418-4716-9221-c9108804d0b3" facs="#m-95d40c9f-0756-4ef6-86bf-4432b19bf778" label="lyrics-like">istum, et pónite eum in látere</l><l xml:id="m-e1e5e7c2-9ed3-42f9-9f76-ec39387f1f6e" facs="#m-7005df21-7507-4137-b86d-3d18f045900f" label="lyrics-like">enim introdúces filios Israël in</l><l xml:id="m-35243a5c-3479-410c-a2d8-19b1c3d241ee" facs="#m-bea86cbd-99b4-41e7-a85f-efe5b0789daa" label="lyrics-like">arcae fœ́deris Dómini Del ve¬</l><l xml:id="m-76fa9d2b-406a-4ac3-9a67-7df7850b0977" facs="#m-9e29dadf-ed1d-426b-bd55-90e2d3d1f75e" label="ambiguous">terram, quam pollicitus sum,</l><l xml:id="m-9da1ac1d-3db9-4737-aac0-1263dc3e15c3" facs="#m-831aef07-4704-4afd-90d2-d92e9ddc58cd" label="ambiguous">et ego ero tecum». Postquam stri: ut sit ibi contra te</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
